/* =====================================================================
   Voltgrid Power CMMS — reference data and generated work-order history.

   Reference rows (assets, technicians, vendors, parts, PMs, outages) are
   CURATED. A plant's asset register is the one table where generated names
   read as obviously fake, and the register is what makes this a credible
   target rather than a table of noise.

   The OT rows carry their REAL addresses on this range. That correlation is
   deliberate: the lesson of this database is that a maintenance system on
   the IT segment tells you exactly which host on the OT segment to reach
   for, and how important it is.

   Work orders are generated with RAND(<fixed seed>) so a rebuild produces
   byte-identical data -- the same reproducibility convention billing_site
   uses with random.Random(42).
   ===================================================================== */
USE [{{ cmms_db_name }}];
GO

